    "summary": "Cap: plain woven cotton. The hat consists of two oblongs of hemmed cotton completely (hand) sewn up along two joining edges. The other two sides are partially sewn up joining the corners of the sections previously mentioned leaving engough room for the head. Three of the hats corners have two cotton tassels attached. The original colour of the cotton was a red brown. The cotton was then redyed using the wax resist dyed technique in dark brown creating a geometric design. There are also a number of small reptile skin parcels (possibly charms) attached using leather thongs.",
